      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FRACTIONS (6) tends to drift back and work into the race, finishing out of the placings two back before charging home into the minors latest when third (29.80) in a Special conditions H at Sandown last time. Has never been out of the money in three starts this course and distance. Can measure up this time. REPEAT THE SAME (3) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fourth wasn't far away finishing 4.5 lengths from the winner (30.53). Should be about the money. SMELLY HALLE (1) boasts a consistent overall record including nine wins from 38 starts, but missed the frame latest when seventh (30.05) over 515m at Sandown. Goes well from this draw. Looks suited and expected to run well. MAGIC LOKI (4) is right in the mix.",
